  "title": "TileColliderMaterialResolver",
  "description": "Per-object collider settings, merged over the call-level defaults. Return `null` to accept the defaults unchanged. Called only while a chunk is being built or rebuilt, never during a no-change import('./TileColliderStreamer').TileColliderStreamer.sync. It is a build-time mapping, not a live rule: changing what the resolver would return has no effect until the layer itself changes.",
